response_shape.key:
{ architects: { mtd, qtd, ytd }, implementors: { mtd, qtd, ytd } }
Each period: { period_start, period_end, display, total_nna, total_inflows, total_outflows,
               prior: {...}, growth_pct, segments: [AdvisorSegment] }
AdvisorSegment: { advisor_name, advisor_id, nna, nna_pct, inflows, outflows, total_aua,
                  client_count, new_clients, prior_nna, nna_growth_pct, rank,
                  prior_rank, rank_change, color }

Legacy rolling series. Each: { advisor_name, advisor_id,
series: { "30d": [Rolling1YDataPoint], "90d": [...], "1Y": [...] } }
Rolling1YDataPoint: { date, nna, inflows, outflows }

{ taxable, taxable_pct, tax_deferred, tax_deferred_pct, tax_free, tax_free_pct,
  qualified_aua, qualified_pct, non_qualified_aua, non_qualified_pct,
  non_qualified_cost_basis, non_qualified_unrealized_gain, short_term_gain, long_term_gain }

Total dimension: { generated_at, data_as_of, firm_id, granularity="monthly", data: [{ period, inflow, outflow, net, txn_count }] }
Category dimension: { categories: ["nmnc","nmec"], data: [{ period, nmnc, nmec, total }] }
Other dimensions: { dimension, dimension_values[], data: [{ period, [dim_val]: { nmnc, nmec, nna_net, outflow, txn_count } }] }

artifact.windows:
Four artifacts, one per window. Window definitions parity with INF_D_06.cash_drag / 49F C_08:
qtd = first day of latest's calendar quarter -> latest; ytd = Jan 1 of latest's year -> latest;
1y = latest - 365 days -> latest; max = earliest TRN trade_date -> latest.

artifact.schema:
Top-level envelope: "49financial" "49 Financial" ISO8601 UTC YYYY-MM-DD (latest atomic NNA date) Self-describing canonical definition (see above). "gold/canonical/nna/{date}.parquet (C_01, bd atomic)" 9 windows: QTD, YTD, MAX, 1Y, 3Y (rolling/standard) + q_current(==QTD), q1, q2, q3 (prior full calendar quarters; snapshot strip). { [window]: { start: YYYY-MM-DD, end: YYYY-MM-DD } } { windows: { [window]: LEAF }, series: SERIES } { [architect_name]: { windows: { [window]: LEAF }, series?: SERIES, clients: { [client_key]: { windows: { [window]: LEAF } } } } } { states: { [state]: { windows: { [window]: LEAF }, cities: { [city]: { windows: { [window]: LEAF } } } } } } ("Other" state / no_city buckets carry join-misses.) { all_pass: bool, tolerance_usd: 0.01, max_abs_delta, series_tie_max_abs_delta, per_window } -- partition-completeness invariants (sum of leaves == parent to the cent across adv/geo/client dims + series-tie). { n_advisors, n_states, n_states_real, n_cities, n_client_leaves, dimensions: ["adv","geo","client"], fee_split, series_policy }
LEAF (every window entry, every grain): { nna: float, inflows: float, outflows: float, account_count: int, fee_paying: null, no_fee: null, -- bd has NO clean per-account fee source; NULL (not fabricated-zero); consumers MUST tolerate null (Inflection/INF_D_00c precedent) nmnc: { nna, inflows, outflows, account_count }, -- households whose relationship_first_seen_date falls within the window (new money new client) nmec: { nna, inflows, outflows, account_count } } -- all others; INVARIANT nmnc.nna + nmec.nna == total.nna (F4b) All dollar values rounded to the cent ONCE at serialization (full precision during aggregation -> round-once; avoids ~0.005*n_leaves cent drift at bd's 61-advisor scale).
SERIES (L1 only -- firm / advisor / state): { weekly: [PERIOD], monthly: [PERIOD], quarterly: [PERIOD] } -- city/client L2 drill carry light monthly-only series or none. PERIOD = { period: str, period_end: YYYY-MM-DD, nna, inflows, outflows } (bucket-summed; sum of buckets == leaf MAX-window nna).
